# ONNX Layer

- ONNX-specific code lives in `AudioSeparator.Onnx`, not Core
- `InferenceSpecReader` introspects session input/output metadata
- `OnnxInferenceTask` runs chunked inference; output layout `[batch, stems, channels, frames]`
- Sample rate comes from `SeparationRequirements`, not from the ONNX model
- Demucs backend: `AudioSeparator.Onnx.Demucs` — one model, not the project name
